{"372890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Red Crow Mysteries: Legion", "steam_appid": 372890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/372890/extras/fbc83f56c44847506c9615398a68c8ef.avif?t=1764329477\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shadows of Red Crow Mysteries: Legion, a dark hidden-object adventure filled with puzzles, mystery, and supernatural secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your special gift allows you to see beyond the veil of reality — but that gift comes at a price. The Legion is waiting. Are you ready to face it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And as you step outside, just to learn that nothing is the same anymore, you will search for clues, investigate surroundings, explore many different locations and seeks for helpful hidden objects and items. But beware, a man in a fine suite and with the friendly smile is not who he truly is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/372890/extras/e12df74d49c83c2c80d6e0a9962cb16b.avif?t=1764329477\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>🔎 Hidden Object &amp; Puzzle Adventure – investigate  scenes and solve mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Dozens of locations &amp; mini-games – mystery lurks from every dark corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ Map &amp; Journal – always know where to go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 Full voiceovers &amp; HD visuals – immerse yourself in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ 3 difficulty levels – from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📴 Play completely offline — anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔒 No data 